 "title": "Vesuvius Erupted in 1944",
 "sentences": [
  "The volcano that buried Pompeii erupted again in 1944.",
  "It was March, in the middle of World War Two, and Allied troops held Naples.",
  "Lava flows destroyed villages on its slopes, including San Sebastiano.",
  "At a nearby American airfield, ash and hot rock wrecked somewhere between 78 and 88 B-25 bombers.",
  "Twenty-six civilians were killed, and about twelve thousand people were displaced.",
  "Vesuvius hasn't erupted since, and around three million people live near it today.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
